<title>USA: New York grain freight fixtures - Oct 29.</title>
<headline>New York grain freight fixtures - Oct 29.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>TBN 25,000 long tons hss 10-20/11 USG/Acaba 5,000/3,000 $27.50 Andre.</p>
<p>TBN 25,000 long tons hss mid-Nov NoPac/Phillipines 5,000/3,000 $26.00 Glencore.</p>
<p>Hanjin TBN Q1 '97 USG/Japan $22.30 no combo Marubeni.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk +1 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
